Short Description:

The item "Labour - STD" with description "ERROR - No Required Rates Found" is added by the script when no chargeable rates are calculated for the Sales Order.

This happens in addRequiredRates() when:

JavaScript
Object.keys(rates).length == 0

Show more lines

Meaning the rates object returned from gatherRates() is empty. Common reasons include:

No maintenance charges found for the project.
No valid asset testing records on the case.
All tested assets were filtered out (outcome = "No Test").
No applicable labour/callout rates were generated.

In this scenario, the script intentionally adds item 2647 (Labour - STD) with the description:

ERROR - No Required Rates Found

Show more lines

to alert Accounts that the order could not determine the required billing items automatically.
